      "description": "<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1026\"><strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1026\">Sly &amp; The Family Stone – Greatest Hits (1970)</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1049\">Epic Records PE 30325</p>\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1097\">A classic funk and soul compilation featuring:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1294\">\n<li data-section-id=\"cyachj\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1126\">\nI Want To Take You Higher\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rxr9ai\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1148\">\nEverybody Is A Star\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"660osl\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1157\">\nStand!\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3unv2\" data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1164\">\nLife\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"el2e6e\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1185\">\nDance To The Music\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ytqrd6\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1203\">\nEveryday People\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kfdvz0\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1231\">\nHot Fun In The Summertime\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mi4qxk\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1273\">\nThank You (Falettinme Be Mice Elf Agin)\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"srudcx\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1294\">\nSing A Simple Song\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1309\"><strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1309\">Condition</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1327\"><strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1321\">Vinyl:</strong> VG+</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1442\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqf9j1\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1350\">\nGood gloss and shine\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xe4a7r\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1399\">\nLight surface marks consistent with normal use\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xkkpl2\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1429\">\nNo major scratches observed\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ea60tp\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1442\">\nPlays well\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1487\"><strong data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1454\">Cover:</strong> Generic white replacement sleeve</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1565\">\n<li data-section-id=\"rywa0p\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1524\">\nOriginal album jacket not included\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fkoa5f\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1565\">\nArtist and title handwritten on sleeve</li></ul>",
